{
  "key": 19227,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0378_R31_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "...Hnuurg ...Huh?\r",
        "I walked too far today looking\n",
        "for Pokémon.\r",
        "My feet hurt and I’m sleepy...\r",
        "If I were a wild Pokémon, I’d be\n",
        "easy to catch...\r",
        "...Zzzz..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0378_R31_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "...Hnuurg! ...Huh?\r",
        "I feel like reading some words\n",
        "on a piece of paper or something...\r",
        "...Zzz...\n",
        "...!!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0378_R31_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Huh? What?\n",
        "What about that Pokémon?\f",
        "I don’t have any mail.\r",
        "Zzz..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0378_R31_00003",
      "en_US": "This Mail isn’t for me."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0378_R31_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, hey! I got an email!\r",
        "...\n",
        "Huh?\f",
        "I don’t know this Pokémon.\f",
        "I’ll just let you take care of it.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0378_R31_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} handed over the Pokémon\n",
        "holding the Mail."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0378_R31_00006",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} handed over the Mail."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0378_R31_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Let’s see...\r",
        "“Thank you for your Mail.\n",
        "It was such an exciting adventure.\r",
        "I did not like ZUBAT, though...”\n",
        "That’s what it says.\r",
        "I went to a dark cave the other day\n",
        "with a friend.\r",
        "That cave leads to another route.\n",
        "By the way, I must thank you for\f",
        "being so kind.\r",
        "I’d like to do something good in return.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0378_R31_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "TM44 is...\n",
        "...Zzz...\f",
        "...\r",
        "...Umm... Rest!\r",
        "The phrase “recover fast” became\n",
        "shortened to “Rest,” you see?\f",
        "This is a move to sleep and recover HP."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0378_R31_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "...I’m\n",
        "sleepy..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0378_R31_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "...Wait!\n",
        "That would make you not have\f",
        "any Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0378_R31_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "I found a good Pokémon in Dark Cave.\n",
        "I’m going to raise it to take on\f",
        "Falkner.\r",
        "He’s the leader of Violet City’s Gym."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0378_R31_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Dark Cave...\r",
        "If a Pokémon could light it up,\n",
        "I’d explore it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0378_R31_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Rt. 31\n",
        "West to Violet City"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0378_R31_00014",
      "en_US": "Dark Cave"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0378_R31_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Huh? What is it?\n",
        "Is that a Pokémon Egg?\f",
        "I’ve never seen one.\r",
        "...Zzz..."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
